{"id":"55","title":"玄机赋","guide":"本篇讨论“玄机赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。","blocks":[{"heading":"","original":"太极判为天地，一气分有阴阳。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"日干为主，专论财官。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"月支取格，乃分贵贱。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有格不正者，败。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"无格有用者，成。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有官，莫寻格局。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有格局，喜官星。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"官印财食无破，清高。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"杀伤梟刃，用之为吉。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"善恶相交，喜去杀而从善。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"吉凶混杂，忌害吉以化凶。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有官有杀，宜身旺，制杀为奇。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有官有印，畏财兴，助财为祸。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身强杀浅，杀运无妨。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"杀重身轻，制乡为福。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身旺印多，喜行财地。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"财多身弱，畏入财乡。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"男逢比劫伤官，剋妻害子。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"女犯伤官偏印，丧子刑夫。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"幼失双亲，财星太重。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"为人孤剋，身旺无依。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"年冲月令，离祖成家。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"日破提冲，弦断再续。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"时日对冲，伤妻剋子。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"日通月令，得祖安身。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"木遇春长，遇庚辛反假为权。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"火归夏生，见壬癸能为福厚。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"土逢辰戌丑未，木重成名。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"金坐申酉之中，火乡发福。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"水居亥子，戊己难侵。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身坐休囚，平生未济。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身旺喜逢禄马。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身弱忌见财官。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"得时俱为旺论。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"失令便作衰看。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"四柱无根，得时为旺。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"日干无气，遇劫为强。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身弱喜印。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"主旺宜官。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"财官印綬，破则无功。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"杀伤梟劫，去之为福。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"甲乙秋生金透露，水木火运荣昌。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"丙丁冬降水汪洋，火土木方贵显。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"戊己春生，西南方有救。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"庚辛夏长，水土运无伤。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"壬癸逢于土旺，金木宜荣。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身弱有印，杀旺无伤；忌行财地。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"伤官伤尽，行官运以无妨。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"伤官用印宜去财。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"伤官用财宜去印。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"是或，伤官财印俱彰，将何发福；身旺者用财，身弱者用印。用财去印，用印去财，方发弥福；正所谓喜者存之，憎者去之。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"财多身弱，身旺以为荣。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身旺财衰，财旺乡而发福。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"重犯官星，只宜制伏。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"食神叠见，须忌官乡。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"顽金无火，大用不成。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"强木无金，清名难著。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"水多得土，财多蓄。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"火焰逢波（水星），禄位高。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"有官有印，无破无荣。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"无印无官，有格取贵。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"阳刃格喜偏官。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"金神最宜制伏。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"杂气财官，刑冲则发。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"官贵太盛，旺处必倾。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身太旺，喜见财官。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"主太柔，不宜禄马。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"旺官旺印与旺财，入墓有祸。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"伤官食神并身旺，遇库兴灾。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"运贵在于支取。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"岁重向乎干求。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"印多者，行财而发。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"财旺者，遇比何妨。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"格清局正，富贵荣华。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"印旺官旺，声名特达。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"合官，非为贵取。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"合杀，莫作凶推。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"桃花带杀，喜淫奔。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"华盖逢空，多刻剥。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"平生不发，八字休囚。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"一世无权，身衰遇鬼。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身旺者，则宜泄、宜伤。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"身衰者，则喜扶、喜助。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"稟中和，莫令太过不及。","commentary":""},{"heading":"","original":"若遵此法推详，祸福验如影响。","commentary":""}]}
